{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qX9zrYiYHTW5D6GK8RWaCw?scene=1&click_id=20","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:16.886795+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qX9zrYiYHTW5D6GK8RWaCw?scene=1&click_id=20","html":"<div><section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Lzpictbz2YD9YLwsjgTLfcxas4NkwHbEuEorHBpHzJnBbTViaFQsAVeZX9X4ribEM2AQkjlFcMRmnQqr8kzRiaLm0tibsYfYXribj1S5OOR0zKReQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Lzpictbz2YDic2aYWpsaR0gR5FMInZmSLqYbor5ibEEXyNtqGLtoadpIo0B9dJrVKhAUPdtGCKV6ILxic703sTHVX2qujPBcecQNFIQBt4AJm28/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>#科创商学体验营#</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>南方科技大学商学院以“科技创新驱动商业变革”为核心理念，致力于培养具有国际视野和创新能力的商业人才。为加强高校间优秀大学生的沟通与交流，帮助广大学子深入了解南科大商学院，培育学生科研兴趣、激发创新潜力，商学院欢迎全国优秀大学生报名2026年科创商学体验营活动。通过参与即可获得：</span></p><p><span>·真实商业案例的完整研究经历</span></p><p><span>·可写入简历的实践经历</span></p><p><span>·行业专家近距离的接触与指导机会</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>现启动报名工作，具体安排如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>专业介绍</span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Lzpictbz2YDic1xqpRwYse9AzyuGI5vXNCsMTyWbB4iaJcoTxEr6l6JibWiceMOeokKlDogrdGqkibcNQ6dNDx7gjuua1szHBfqCErFU9MjgcW8Dg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>金融专硕</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>南方科技大学金融专业硕士项目聚焦于发掘与培养兼具创新思维与实践能力的金融领域青年人才，通过整合前沿学术资源、搭建高阶实践平台，为有志于深耕金融行业的学生提供系统性成长支持。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>管理科学与工程</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>培养具备坚实而广泛的基础理论知识和深入系统的专业知识、具有强大分析和解决问题能力、能够在特定领域或方向上独立开展高水平的学术研究和教学工作的创新型人才。通过宽口径、厚基础的积累，培养懂科学、擅经营、谙管理的跨学科复合型高端人才。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>申请条件</span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Lzpictbz2YDib7s8YBZKcRTVqatOW6gWgJBxKeicykYCibqeUzY774hdFhP4yOXdia2tGoKXeQNFZL8djWehlblTMvcic4NBvYlcT2DhfHriaPsibbI/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.</span><span>全国高校本科三年级在校生（2027届本科毕业生），可获得免推资格的本科生优先考虑</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>2.鼓励跨专业申请，申请学生的专业方向不限；</span></p><p><span>3.对金融科技创新有浓厚兴趣；</span></p><p><span>4.学业成绩优秀，英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>5.身心健康，学风端正。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>活动安排</span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>活动时间</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2026年6月29日-30日（拟定）</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>活动特色</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>体验营为有意向加入南科大商学院的同学提供展示创新成果与团队协作能力的舞台，基于业界真实痛点和素材进行小组研讨与方案设计，开展创新大赛。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>活动安排（拟）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>开营仪式、学术前沿讲座、行业专家座谈会、企业参访、创新大赛（小组案例研讨成果展示，优异小组将获得个人获奖证书）</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>活动费用</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院为所有营员提供体验营期间的伙食。非深圳本地营员的住宿由学院统一安排，学院承担绝大部分住宿费用，营员仅需象征性承担少量费用。往返交通费用需由营员自理，请提前到达或推迟离开的营员自行解决在深圳的各项事宜。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><em><span>（体验营活动安排根据情况调整，以最终邮件通知为准。具体大赛细则将于确定入营后通过邮件通知，请密切关注。营员须全程参加活动。）</span></em></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>申请流程</span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>即日起至2026年6月21日 23:59，</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>逾期不再受理</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>报名方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人登陆南科大研究生报考服务系统，点击“全国优秀大学生交流营”，并按要求提供本人各项真实信息。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>网址： https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/（建议使用Chrome或360极速浏览器）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>操作指引</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>选择\"全国优秀大学生交流营\"→院系选择\"商学院\"→填报专业（金融/管理科学与工程）→填写报名信息→上传材料保存提交</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>需上传以下证明材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科成绩单：包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务公章），成绩单上注明所在专业的成绩排名；</span></p><p><span>（4）个人陈述：介绍学术背景、曾经做过的工作或研究、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内；</span></p><p><span>（5）个人简历：须涵盖个人基本信息、学校、专业、英文能力、年级排名（示例：1/100）、GPA、科研和获奖情况，社会工作等；</span></p><p><span>（6）其他材料:其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页及奖状证书等），扫描为一个PDF文件后上传至系统；</span></p><p><span>（7）报名申请表（签字版）：请先在系统完成报名申请，提交后下载打印报名申请表，按要求签字后提交至系统。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>未在报名系统中报名者，不予受理</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>资格审核及确认参加</span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Lzpictbz2YDibfcFMB3iag8NkstChiahnh8BpwaUo0FLQz67icMvzPNZzrDbErwMcjU1ohicHKIictxOJqSJaL1avWKA7UR7lfvN8V2iaflofrg98hM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>体验营审核工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将分批次以电子邮件形式通知，未通过审核者不作另外通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><ol><li><p><span>确认参加时间：6月17日-6月24日</span></p></li></ol><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2. 学生确认：收到入营邮件的同学请在</span><span><strong><span>6月24日下午4点前</span></strong></span><span>在系统确认是否参加体验营。确认参营的同学，请注意邮箱接收入群通知，以便接收后续通知。逾期未确认者视为放弃参加体验营。暂未通过资格确认的同学审核状态不改变，如有后期补录，将会通知到个人。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>联系方式</span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>有关体验营活动咨询，请优先以“体验营咨询”为邮件主题发送给对应专业老师邮箱，同学们也可以移步商学院官网或者公众号自行了解更多。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>金融（专硕）</span></strong><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>联系人：</span></strong><span>乔老师</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>联系电话：</span></strong><span>0755-88012574</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>咨询邮箱：</span></strong><span>qiaohl@mail.sustech.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><b><span>管理科学与工程</span></b></span></p><p><span><strong><span>联系人：李</span></strong><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>联系电话：</span></strong><span>0755-88012805</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>咨询邮箱：</span></strong><span>cob_yzb@sustech.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>学院官网：</span></p><p><span>https://business.sustech.edu.cn/index.php   </span><span><span>了解更多商学院介绍及各专业项目介绍</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Lzpictbz2YD9zX59Omuph6uXEKVicQH2uIvu8aX6KicZu8xCkd8sukSABoGxyAqfFAsL90HVtWdicsDwloADMuQ9KUdzbuGS3ISvMzFPL6nPxX8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"56e9e26ad5a6d2e6c8228a359cce14037c179c9753c340304d47bd4ac17d9d0f","textLength":1897,"sourceSha256":"92afb6501a6448798b5540e94215e91fe78652a57936d880b1201013697437b3","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-578a2d6e36ed2